          <a href="https://github.com/0xCyb3rgh0st" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="footer-link">GitHub</a>
          <a href="https://x.com/0xCyb3rgh0st" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="footer-link">X (Twitter)</a>
